<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ascend cut to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ascend cut to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said it downgraded Ascend Communications Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Ascend said it agreed to acquire Cascade Communications Corp in a stock deal valued at about $3.7 billion.</p>
<p>-- Ascend's stock dropped 11 to 41.</p>
</text>
